    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span><span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Stack</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/valid-parentheses/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 20</a></div>\n  <h1>Valid Parentheses</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: the most recently opened bracket must be the first one closed, so push the closer you owe on every opener and pop-and-compare on every closer; the string is valid only if nothing fails and the stack ends empty. O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
